# Week 1 — Python & AI Engineering Foundations

This repository documents my first week of learning and building practical projects in Python and AI engineering.

## What I Worked On
- **Day 1:** Python fundamentals and introduction to LLM APIs.
- **Day 2:** Working with LLMs and API integration.
- **Day 3:** Practical Python programming and experimentation.
- **Day 4:** Building and improving AI-powered applications.
- **Day 5:** AI-powered Resume Parser and Candidate Screening System.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- uv — Python project and dependency management
- Groq API — LLM integration
- Pydantic — Data validation and structured outputs
- python-dotenv — Environment variable management
- pypdf — PDF text extraction
- python-docx — Word document processing

## Goal
My goal is to develop strong foundations in Python, machine learning, and large language models by building projects from scratch, understanding the underlying concepts, and improving my engineering skills through hands-on practice.

**This is an ongoing learning journey. More projects and improvements will be added as I progress.**